'''Rei Uzumasa & Cat ''' is a [[:Category:Special Cats|Special Cat]] that was added in [[Version 7.0 Update|Version 7.0]] and can be obtained as a login reward during the [[Get On! Kyoto City Subway Collaboration Event]].

{{Cat Info
|ID = 425
|rarity = EX
|name1 = Rei Uzumasa & Cat
|name2 = Rei Uzumasa & Cat CC
}}

==Evolution==
Evolves into '''Rei Uzumasa & Cat CC''' at level 10.

==Strategy/Usage==
This unit has a similar role to [[Sunny Neneko (Super Rare Cat)|Sunny Neneko]], being an early-game counter against Metal enemies, particularly against ones with low health such as [[Metal Hippoe]], [[Pure Gold R.Ost]] and [[CyberFace|Cyberface]]. Due to her awful attack power, it's not recommended to use her against more powerful Metal Enemies such as [[Super Metal Hippoe]] or [[Sir Metal Seal]].

Her use in mid to late-game is basically nonexistent as she's easily replaced by [[Cheerleader Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Cheerleader Cat]], who has much better health and damage. However, she is a Special Cat, so she may have use in 4-Crown stages if no alternatives are available.

{{Job|Classification = Critter}}

